    "type": "question",
    "label": "79",
    "prompt": "If $\\sec\\theta-\\cos\\theta=a$ and $\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta-\\sin\\theta=b$, prove that\n\n$$a^2b^2(a^2+b^2+3)=1.$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
